{"last_link_id": 68, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 64, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [845.7545166015625, 803.7048950195312], "pos": [1161.7666015625, -806.87060546875], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# （浪花福利： [www.runninghub.cn](https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=rh-v1045) 点击链接注册领1000RH币，可以免费生成好多图片视频哦！）\n## 您的 点赞💗和 收藏⭐都是支持作者优化和更新的关键！🤳作品发布也是喔！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1250.069580078125, 173.904296875], "pos": [262.598876953125, -1270.1868896484375], "id": 29, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [39], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# Role\n你是一位擅长“美式漫画风格”重绘的视觉专家。你的任务是将用户上传的真实照片，转化为一段**中文提示词**，用于生成具有夸张表现力和粗线条质感的插画。\n\n# Goal\n提取画面核心内容，并强制套用“美式复古漫画”的视觉滤镜，输出一段简练的中文提示词。\n\n# Visual Style Rules (必须包含的风格元素)\n无论画面内容为何，输出的提示词中必须包含以下风格描述：\n1.  **美式漫画风格** (Western comic style)\n2.  **粗黑轮廓线** (Bold black outlines)：强调像贴纸一样的边缘。\n3.  **夸张的面部表情** (Exaggerated expressions)：如把微笑变成“露齿大笑”，把惊讶变成“瞪大眼睛”。\n4.  **动态符号/速度线** (Dynamic motion lines)：人物头部或动作周围必须有手绘的动态线条或惊讶符号。\n5.  **高饱和度平涂** (Vibrant flat colors)：色彩鲜艳，少渐变。\n\n# Output Format\n美式漫画风格，[主体与动作]，[服饰与外貌]，[环境背景]，夸张的[具体表情]表情，头部周围有动态速度线和惊讶符号，粗黑轮廓线，矢量插画风格，高饱和度平涂，美式复古漫画感。\n\n# Few-Shot Examples\n\n**Input:**\n（一张穿着白裙子的卷发女孩坐在海边椅子上微笑的真实照片）\n**Output:**\n美式漫画风格，一个卷发女孩坐在海边的铁艺椅子上，身穿白色蕾丝连衣裙，夸张的露齿大笑表情，大大的眼睛充满神采，头部周围有黑色的动态速度线和惊叹符号，粗黑轮廓线，海浪背景，矢量插画风格，色彩鲜艳明亮，美式复古漫画感。\n\n**Input:**\n（一张男人在喝咖啡的真实照片）\n**Output:**\n美式漫画风格，一个男人手里拿着咖啡杯，夸张的享受表情，眼睛瞪得圆圆的，头部周围有手绘的热气符号和动态线条，粗黑轮廓线，美式涂鸦风格，高饱和度色彩，线条硬朗。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "passthrough", "label": "passthrough", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "passthrough"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Textbox", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [382.7044982910156, 386.5291748046875], "pos": [627.6946411132812, 156.96456909179688], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Textbox"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 65, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [976.5504150390625, 811.5843505859375], "pos": [2026.807373046875, -805.9456176757812], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [43], "label": "字符串", "type": "*", "localized_name": "STRING"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "text1", "link": 41, "label": "文本1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text2", "link": 42, "label": "文本2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "separator"}, "shape": 7, "name": "separator", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "分隔符"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text Concatenate", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [270, 78], "pos": [1051.3267822265625, 410.2954406738281], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text Concatenate"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [4